---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_active: caller is investor
    q_check_active --> q_check_ended: sale active check
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_saft: verify SAFT signature (amount, allocationRate)
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid or replayed
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_saft --> q_check_amount: signature valid, mark used
    q_check_amount --> q_update_position: investAmount <= cachedInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: investAmount > cachedInvestAmount
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert ExceedsSAFTLimit
    q_update_position --> q_cache: investedCapital += amount
    q_cache --> q_transfer: cachedInvestAmount = saftLimit, cachedTokenAllocationRate = rate
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer bidToken from investor, emit Invested

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: each signature can only be used once (replay prevention)
        INV-002: investedCapital never exceeds cachedInvestAmount after invest
        INV-003: cachedTokenAllocationRate uses 18 decimal precision
    end note

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-004: bidToken transfer must succeed (SafeERC20)
        INV-005: individual refund period starts from last invest tx timestamp
    end note
